WEBVTT

00:29:00.064 --> 00:29:01.795
AG: Lynda was onto something.

00:29:01.819 --> 00:29:03.326
By experimenting with new tools

00:29:03.350 --> 00:29:06.024
and following her curiosities
to uncharted places,

00:29:06.048 --> 00:29:08.651
she could carve out a niche
and continue iterating

00:29:08.675 --> 00:29:09.918
instead of stagnating.

00:29:09.942 --> 00:29:12.687
LW: Oh, do I want to do
what everybody else is doing,

00:29:12.711 --> 00:29:15.196
or I'm being asked to do something

00:29:15.220 --> 00:29:18.648
that only I know how to do,
and maybe that's more fun.

00:29:18.672 --> 00:29:20.683
AG: Lynda ran two more experiments.

00:29:20.707 --> 00:29:23.226
First, she started teaching
in-person college classes

00:29:23.250 --> 00:29:24.662
in web design.

00:29:24.686 --> 00:29:27.387
Then when she saw a lack
of good manuals for students,

00:29:27.411 --> 00:29:28.656
she wrote one herself.

00:29:28.680 --> 00:29:31.201
LW: Then it became a huge success,